venv/

# NOTE: do NOT ignore images/*.webp or images/og-image.jpg.
# The <picture> elements in index.html/privacy.html and the two LCP
# <link rel="preload"> tags reference the .webp files directly, and the
# Open Graph / Twitter tags reference og-image.jpg. If those files are not
# committed they 404 on GitHub Pages: every visitor silently falls back to
# the ~35 MB of PNGs, and link previews break.
